      "message": "Nit: After reading the rest of the paragraph I see that `getResource` here refers to a `getResource` call that returns a texture, but that wasn\u0027t immediately clear since getResource can return either a texture or a sampler (likewise it\u0027s swapped in number `6` where `getResource` now refers to a sampler).\n\nIn my mind I\u0027m using the phrases \"resource texture\", \"resource sampler\", \"bindful texture\", and \"bindful sampler\" to keep track of what is coming from where. But also \"resource texture\" is kind vague. Maybe \"resource table texture\", but that\u0027s kinda long...",
